OL,4,CMP criticises company ownership        
OL,5,Cregister plans                         
OL,6,GPlans to improve transparency over     
OL,7,Gcompany ownership in Guernsey and      
OL,8,GJersey have come under criticism from  
OL,9,Ga Westminster MP, who says they "do    
OL,10,Gnot go nearly far enough".             
OL,12,FThe comments come after Guernsey and   
OL,13,FJersey set out plans to allow approved 
OL,14,Fapplicants access to information about 
OL,15,Fwho owns or controls companies when    
OL,16,Finvestigating suspected financial      
OL,17,Fcrime.                                 
